  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/bARZ5Zc.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/fk8AIEm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"115\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">***&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shetiphiancore\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要 ShetiPhianCore！</a> ***</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">在另一个维度中储存液体。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/B0NBcH4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">末影储罐</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">所有相同颜色的储罐始终相连。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">提供全局、个人和团队模式。（<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endertanks/pages/main\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多详情</a>）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按住 Shift 并右键点击储罐以染料更改带颜色。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/984/tanks-crop.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"459\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/B0NBcH4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">末影桶</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">链接到储罐，以便方便地访问储存的液体。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按住 Shift 并右键点击储罐以进行链接。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/985/bucket-crop-f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"284\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/B0NBcH4.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交本地化文件。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>请勿在评论中发布错误报告，请使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>。</strong></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
